    "inputs": {
      "prompts": "detailed_description:\n[Shot 1] 0–3s: Wide shot. <Subject 1> stands on a rain-slicked rooftop at night, city skyline behind her. She is center-frame, facing camera, hair blowing in wind. <Picture 1> is referenced as visual anchor. She is silent, mouth closed, no lip-sync.\n[Shot 2] 3–7s: Close-up on <Subject 1>'s face. She smirks, eyes catch neon reflections. No singing, no speaking.\n[Shot 3] 7–10s: Camera pulls back. She takes a slow step forward. Pink and blue neon signs flicker in background. Freeze on her confident stance.",
      "global_text": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young girl in <Picture 1>, with blonde hair tied back with pink hair clips, blue eyes, light complexion, subtle blush. She wears a light grey zip-up hoodie with pink graphic text, white t-shirt with cartoon cat face, black jogger pants, white chunky sneakers, blue fingerless gloves with dark dots. Confident, mischievous smile.\n\n<Picture 1> is the full-body reference image, used as visual anchor for <Subject 1>'s appearance, clothing, and initial pose.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A 10-second visual-only music video segment. <Subject 1> performs choreographed movement and action in a neon-lit urban night environment. She does NOT sing, does NOT speak, and has NO lip-sync. No vocals, no dialogue. Only visual performance, camera movement, and VFX synchronized to non-diegetic music.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> fully preserved as visual basis. <Subject 1>'s identity, outfit, facial features retained throughout. No singing, no speaking, no lip movement.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nUrban night ambience: distant traffic, soft rain, neon buzz, footsteps on wet surfaces.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nDriving synthwave electronic score, heavy bassline, arpeggiated synths, punchy four-on-the-floor beat, fast tempo. Intensity matches visual performance.",
      "clip": [
        "4",
        0
      ]
